    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοίτ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>regular</i> or <i>repeated going,</i> mostly in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐπὶ τὰς θύρας φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.6.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν εἰς τοὺς γάμους καὶ γενέθλια
				φοιτήσεων</span>
			<i>resortings</i> to marriages . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				784d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>going to school,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				764d
			</span></i> (pl.): hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ φοιτήσεώς
			τινος</span> of his <i>school,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.17.4
			</span></i>.</div>
